Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: Cron job not running

Check cron service: sudo systemctl status cron
Verify cron syntax: Use online cron validators
Check permissions: Ensure scripts are executable
Review logs: grep CRON /var/log/syslog
Issue: Model server won't start

Check port availability: netstat -tuln | grep 5000
Verify virtual environment activation
Check Python dependencies: pip list
Review Flask logs for errors
Issue: Import errors in scripts

Ensure virtual environment is activated
Reinstall packages: pip install -r requirements.txt
Check Python version: python3 --version
Issue: Model file not found

Verify training completed successfully
Check models directory: ls -lh models/
Ensure symlink was created: ls -l models/latest_model.pkl
